  "limitations": [
    "Fragment compilation, synthetic guest memory and COM objects; no full-module/build/browser/original-game qualification.",
    "Actual Node worker_threads transport is covered; browser Worker execution is not.",
    "COM Release endpoint and dx_free are actual production forms. Creation and reuse reconstruct a synthetic slot; production CreateDevice/allocator/thunk dispatch and heap reclamation are not tested. heap_free is a fixture no-op.",
